# pgBackRest schedules (P0-28, REL-1), run by supercronic in the compose service `backup`, UTC.
# Repo 1 (local): weekly full, daily diff, incremental every 6 hours. Repo 2 (B2): weekly full
# and daily diff. WAL is archived continuously to both (archive_timeout = 60s).
7 3 * * 0     /usr/local/bin/run-backup.sh 1 full
7 3 * * 1-6   /usr/local/bin/run-backup.sh 1 diff
37 */6 * * *  /usr/local/bin/run-backup.sh 1 incr
27 3 * * 0    /usr/local/bin/run-backup.sh 2 full
27 3 * * 1-6  /usr/local/bin/run-backup.sh 2 diff
